{
  "about": "Test vectors for the track rules of docs/spec/mobile.md 5.4: the fix filter, the speed cap and the distance sum. They are read by two tests so that the device and the server agree: web/packages/trip-core/src/track.test.ts runs every case through analyseTrack, and crates/modules/mileage/src/track.rs runs the same cases through the Rust function the server uses. `t` is milliseconds since the Unix epoch; `accuracyM` is optional. `expect.distance_m` is the summed distance rounded to two decimals, the way the server stores it; `expect.integrity` is the flag text the server stores. All positions are synthetic. To change a case, change it here and run both tests.",
